note for HappyHourPolicy "NEW; owner B. NEW: activate once in turns 1..18. Active at t and t+1; remaining duration 2, 1, then 0. / Read-only queries accept turn 0 for pre-game UI; quote requires turn 1..18. Negative turns rejected. / quote calls customer.priceFor(item) once, then applies 80% only if active. Reject null/negative quote; use long half-up. / Activation at turn 18 is allowed: UI explains that the game still ends at 18. No extra turn is added."
